# Files uploaded to EAS Build servers are excluded here.
#
# The project .env holds server-side secrets (SMS provider key, OTP signing
# secret). Those belong on the backend only (AGENTS.md — never expose API keys
# or partner credentials on the client), so they must never reach a build.
# Client config is passed through EXPO_PUBLIC_* env vars on EAS instead.
.env
.env.*.local

# Large design references — not needed to build the app.
prompt aide/
prompt1/
prompt_material/
prompts/
